      "content": "it's just not the same though. \"professional help\" is for people who actually have a life to go back to. i've already lost everything. the social structure i was part of is just gone. there's no \"fixing\" it when you've been fundamentally erased by everyone. it feels more like a fact than just a feeling. like, if no one acknowledges you, do you even really exist?",
